      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "We thank you and the reviewers for the careful reading of our manuscript. We have addressed every comment below. Reviewer comments are in ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "bold",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": ", our responses in plain text, and changes to the manuscript are ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "highlighted in italics",
          "marks": [
            "italic"
          ],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Page and line numbers refer to the revised version.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
